1","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"欧罗娜，我们来给你送信啦。是沙利叶让我们亲手交给你的信函哦！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:4:1423379002:1":{"key":"say:4:1423379002:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1423379002","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"是沙利叶大人托你们交给我的吗……我想，我大概知道信函的...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1423379003:1":{"key":"say:5:1423379003:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1423379003","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"是什么呀？好想知道！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1423379004:1":{"key":"say:6:1423379004:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1423379004","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"好奇的话，我就打开让大家一起看看吧。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"document:7:244:0":{"key":"document:7:244:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"致欧罗娜女士：\n因您高尚的品格与卓越的才学，以及对教育事业的热忱，本人沙利叶，作为泽被小学的建校发起人，诚挚地向您发出邀请，决定长期聘任您为本校教师。\n您将在这里分享知识、传递希望，守护这些纯真的心灵。我深信，您的智慧与耐心将点亮课堂，也点亮这些孩子的人生。\n<align=\"right\">沙利叶","textdes_id":"244","document_page_count":"1","document_title_cn":"教师聘任书","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"0","document_item_id":"0","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item18.png","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item18.prefab","document_pic":"","document_gender":"false"},"say:8:1423379005:0":{"key":"say:8:1423379005:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1423379005","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"是聘任书！而且是一封邀请你长期担任泽被小学教师的聘任书！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:9:1423379006:1":{"key":"say:9:1423379006:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1423379006","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"欧罗娜，你现在应该很开心吧。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:10:1423379007:1":{"key":"say:10:1423379007:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1423379007","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"其实，之前跟沙利叶大人谈这件事的时候，沙利叶大人就提起...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:11:1423379008:1":{"key":"say:11:1423379008:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1423379008","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"是我主动提议他，在聘任书上加上“长期”两个字。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:12:1423379009:1":{"key":"say:12:1423379009:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1423379009","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"这样，就不会有人产生希娜产生过的担忧，怀疑我会半途而废...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:13:1423379010:1":{"key":"say:13:1423379010:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"13","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1423379010","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我想用这种方式向他们作出承诺，既给这些孩子信心，也给我...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:14:1423379011:1":{"key":"say:14:1423379011:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"14","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1423379011","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我有自信用我的时间将这座学校建设得越来越好，让孩子们能...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"narration:15:1423379012:1":{"key":"narration:15:1423379012:1","kind":"narration","source_node_id":"15","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statemen